==Battleground==
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (1,200%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Satan Claus]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start off with 2 or 3 meatshields, then start stacking [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat/Seafarer Cats]] and an [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] with good range (i.e. [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]], [[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bazibon]], [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]] etc.) and a Cat that can block the [[Warp|warps]] caused by Satan Claus such as [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]].

